'''Feb Rozo''' was a [[Rodian]] [[musician]] active during the [[High Republic Era]]. He played guitar as part of the band [[Feb Rozo and the Sap Tap Trio]], and often performed at [[Hap's Sap Tap]], a [[cafe]] in the town of [[Kublop Springs]] on the planet [[Tenoo]]. Feb was a friend of the cafe's owner, [[Hap]].<ref name="BftB" />

{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Feb Rozo, albeit unidentified, first appeared in "[[The Young Jedi]]," the first part of the [[The Young Jedi / Yoda's Mission|first episode]],<ref name="TYJ" /> as well as multiple other stories within the first batch of episodes, including "[[Yoda's Mission]],"<ref name="Yoda Mission">{{YJA|Yoda's Mission}}</ref> "[[The Junk Giant]],"<ref name="Junk Giant">{{YJA|The Junk Giant}}</ref> "[[The Jellyfruit Pursuit]],"<ref name="The Jellyfruit Pursuit">{{YJA|The Jellyfruit Pursuit}}</ref> and "[[The Missing Kibbin]]," of the [[Disney+]] and [[Disney Junior]] animated series ''[[Star Wars: Young Jedi Adventures]]''{{'}} [[Young Jedi Adventures Season One|first season]].<ref name="The Missing Kibbin">{{YJA|The Missing Kibbin}}</ref> The episodes first aired on [[May 4]], [[2023]].<ref name="D23 May">{{D23|url=everything-new-you-can-stream-on-disney-in-may-2023|text=Everything New You Can Stream on Disney+ in May 2023}}</ref> In [[2024]], "[[Battle for the Band]]," the first part of the [[Battle for the Band / Uprooted|sixth episode]] of the series' [[Young Jedi Adventures Season Two|second season]], identified the Rodian to be Feb Rozo, which was voiced by [[Andrew Kishino]].<ref name="BftB" /> Being an original character, Rozo was designed by [[Madi Hodges]] for the animated series.<ref name="Bialk">{{Instagram|username=andybialk|url=p/C-GtlDtyGsi|name=[[Andy Bialk]]|date=2024-08-01|quote=EXPRESSIONS 🎶Kublop Springs Band🎶 s1 ep1 "The Young Jedi"💫 characters designed by Madi Hodges @starwars 💫Young Jedi Adventures💫|archiveurl=https://archive.ph/uh9lp|archivefile=File:KublopBandExpression-AndyBialk-IG.png}}</ref>

